{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"QueryView","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryView"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"QueryView","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryView.swift#L70","fileName":"QueryView.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule9QueryViewV"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/Iterator"],"generated":true,"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/count","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/filter","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/first"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/added(_:since:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/allowing(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/anyOf(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/changed(_:since:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/filtered(by:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/makeIterator()","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/related(_:to:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/with(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/without(_:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/Sequence-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A lazy sequence of the entities that match a query, with the components the query reads.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You get a view from a world’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"query(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" methods. Each row is a tuple of the entity, labeled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", followed by the values of the query’s terms in the order the query lists them, so a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loop can name them all:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 3, dy: 4))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 1), Frozen())","","for (_, name, velocity) in world.query(Name.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self) {","    print(name.value, velocity.dx)","    \/\/ Prints \"comet 3.0\"","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A view is a snapshot of the world it came from: changing the world while you iterate doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change what the view shows, though the first write to each component type copies that type’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage. To change components while you visit them, use one of the world’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update"},{"type":"text","text":" methods"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrow a view with the same methods a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},{"type":"text","text":" offers, such as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/with(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/without(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Each returns a new view."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rows come in the order of the list the view walks: the storage of the queried or required type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the fewest entities hold, or a shorter list where one applies, such as a target’s sources"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/related(_:to:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or a cached query’s entities. That order depends only on the steps that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built the world, so it’s the same every time you run the same steps."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Querying and Updating Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc